{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The engine’s own darkness is a description problem. A dark room prints “It is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pitch black. You can’t see a thing.”, its contents stop being resolvable nouns,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and the player is inconvenienced. They can stand there for a hundred turns.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This library supplies the consequence, on the schedule the original used.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GameContent"},{"type":"text","text":" bundle with no rooms in it — one namespaced"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"counter, one daemon, four knobs on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"init"},{"type":"text","text":". Wiring is a single line: list the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instance in the game’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"content"},{"type":"text","text":" block. It reads "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"player.location.isLit"},{"type":"text","text":", which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already answers the whole question of whether there is light here from anything,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so a host that has declared its dark rooms and a lamp has declared everything"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this needs. Nothing is passed in per rule; the prose and the schedule are settled"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at "},{"code":"init","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The daemon counts consecutive turns ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"ending","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" in darkness, wherever they are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"spent. Lingering is lethal and movement is not, so a lightless dash toward the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stairs can still work. Any reachable light resets the count to zero. Dark turn 1","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"prints the warning; dark turns 2 through ","type":"text"},{"code":"graceTurns + 1","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" are a silent grace;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from dark turn ","type":"text"},{"code":"graceTurns + 2","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on, every turn rolls ","type":"text"},{"code":"chance(lethality)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"eaten. The warning turn is always safe, which is the classic fairness contract:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a player who UNDOes a death gets the warning beat back before the dice can turn","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on them again."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Two instances in one game collide on their shared ","type":"text"},{"code":"@Global","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" namespace before the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"timer name matters. One lethal dark per game.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Wiring","text":"Wiring","type":"heading","level":2},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import Gnusto","import GnustoDangerousDark","","struct Deeps: Game {","    let title = \"Deeps\"","","    let dark = DangerousDark()   \/\/ stock prose, one turn of grace, 50% a turn","","    var content: GameContents { dark }","","    var map: WorldMap { … }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A game with its own voice for the dark passes all four:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let dark = DangerousDark(","    warning: Prose.grueWarning,","    death: Prose.grueDeath,","    graceTurns: 1,","    lethality: 50)"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"warning","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is said ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"once","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" per turn, through the engine’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"sayOnceThisTurn(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A game that also points ","type":"text"},{"code":"text.pitchBlack","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" at the same sentence — Zork does,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"because there the dark-room line ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"is","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" the threat — reads it a single time on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"turn it walks into the dark, whichever speaker got there first. Two different","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sentences are two different sentences, and both print. A warning swallowed for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"repeating the room’s own line is still a warned turn.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Making-the-dark-harmless","text":"Making the dark harmless","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For a room whose solution is to stand in the dark on purpose, or a scene that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"should not be interrupted, set ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/suspended","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"code":["cryptDoor.after(.close) { dark.suspended = true }","cryptDoor.after(.open) { dark.suspended = false }"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Do not stop the daemon by name."}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" It is called ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"grue\""},{"text":", and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"stopDaemon(\"grue\")"},{"text":" freezes the counter at whatever it had reached, so resuming","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can put the player straight onto a dice turn and cost them the warning.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Suspending resets the count on every suspended turn, for exactly that reason, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"draws no randomness while it is set.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Worked example","anchor":"Worked-example","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Sources\/Zork1\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" wires this over the engine’s own light mechanics — the brass","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lantern is a ","type":"text"},{"code":"lightSource","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on two fuses, and the grue is what makes the fuses","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"matter. The engine’s side of it (the ","type":"text"},{"code":"dark","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" trait, ","type":"text"},{"code":"lightSource","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", what counts as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"light reaching a room, "},{"code":"die(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and the resurrection hook) is the "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Darkness,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Time, and Death"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" article in the "},{"code":"Gnusto","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" documentation."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Darkness that kills: a warning, a grace period, then dice.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustodangerousdark"]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"m